# mappo — product roadmap

## v0.3 arc: beyond the flat SVG
- [ ] Canvas renderer for extreme grids (cols > 260): same options surface,
      renderer picked by density (or `renderer="canvas"` override). Kills the
      animation-at-max-cols warning for good.
- [x] Globe mode (v0.3.0): canvas renderer, orthographic + hemisphere
      culling, limb foreshortening/fade, halo ring, axial tilt via `tilt`,
      `rotate-speed`, offscreen pause, reduced-motion static frame.
- [ ] Drag-to-spin + pointer events on the globe.

## Event surface (the premise asked for "webhooks on animations")
- [ ] Leave events: onDotLeave / onCityLeave (+ worldmap:dotleave etc.).
- [ ] Animation lifecycle hooks: onAnimationCycle (once per period) — cheap via
      one animationiteration listener on a sentinel dot.

## Ideas parked (from the build sessions)
- [ ] Ripple-from-city: animation="ripple" epicenter at a named city instead of
      map center.
- [ ] Region masks: continent/country-only maps ("europe", "americas") — the
      bitmask already supports arbitrary lat/lon windows via latRange + a
      lonRange sibling.
- [ ] Custom city registries as JSON attribute / module import.
- [ ] Dark-surface default palette preset (dot/marker pair tuned for dark
      heroes) — one attribute, e.g. theme="dark".
- [ ] SSR snapshot helper: render the SVG string in Node (all the pieces are
      pure already) for zero-flash first paint.

## Distribution
- [ ] Show HN post (landing is built to receive it).
- [ ] Wrapper docs: React/Vue/Svelte usage snippets in README (it's a custom
      element — mostly "it just works" notes).
- [ ] Screenshot/GIF gallery in README (tilt, shapes, city markers).
- [ ] VehiclesDB hero is live as the first production showcase — link it from
      README once the site deploy ships.

## Quality
- [ ] A11y pass: focusable markers already; add aria-label on markers
      (city name), role="img" + label on the svg.
- [ ] Perf harness: add a canvas-renderer row once it exists; keep budgets.
